      "description": "Every defensive option is rewritten as an attack.\n• **Recover** stops restoring and lands **59 damage** instead.\n• **Defend** stops soaking and counters **20% harder**, off the normal defence-counter calculation.\n• The **Special** lands **3 sabers at 10 stability each** and banks the 30. The NEXT Special cashes that bank for **230 damage** and banks again, so from the second one onward every Special collects.",
